fixture tech10_standing_dash_blocked
doc Control for tech 10: a standing dash into the same 32 u gap stops at the low ceiling
room test/lowgap
spawn 600 544
frames 30
input
  0 R dash
  1..29 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1 height=44
  # The 44-tall box meets the ceiling's face at 640: centre 630.
  at 9 x=630u hit_wall=1
end
